      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's perfect. it really captures that sense of him being this almost supernatural force. can you take it one step further and actually write out a paragraph that specifically mocks the academic historians who focus on \"bread shortages\" or \"taxation\" as the cause? just make it sound like those arguments are intellectually lazy compared to the real power he wielded.",
